OL,3,GNEWSAHarry dives into pickleball during
OL,4,Aschool visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke of Sussex joined
OL,7,Fschoolchildren in Birmingham for a game
OL,8,Fof pickleball as he launched a new
OL,9,FInvictus Games education programme.
OL,11,FPrince Harry visited Ninestiles Academy
OL,12,Fin Acocks Green to mark the launch of
OL,13,FInspire, a scheme designed to use
OL,14,Fstories from Invictus competitors to
OL,15,Fteach children about resilience and
OL,16,Fmental fitness.
OL,18,FDressed casually in a dark polo shirt
OL,19,Fand jeans, the duke appeared relaxed as
OL,20,Fhe played with pupils and later
OL,21,Fanswered their questions.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
