OL,3,GNEWSAHarry dives into pickleball during
OL,4,Aschool visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring several rallies against Year 7
OL,7,Fand Year 11 students, he joked his back
OL,8,Fwas hurting after reaching for a low
OL,9,Fshot and applauded youngsters when they
OL,10,Fwon points.
